      promise: 'We build our own apps for %d platforms, from desktop and mobile to the terminal. The desktop and mobile apps work offline. Apple Mail and other mail apps work too.',
      // macOS, Windows, Linux, iOS, Android and the terminal (the cards below)
      promiseArgs: [6],
      cards: [
